{
    "id":  11131,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Track Spotlight 40W - 28W ODENSE White Single-Phase Track - CCT - CRI+92 - UGR13 - 24º",
    "reference":  "92085-CCT",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eODENSE CCT LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003ecompact and elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e. This model lets you select the color temperature \u003cstrong\u003e(CCT)\u003c/strong\u003e and adjust the \u003cb\u003epower between 40W and 28W\u003c/b\u003e, perfectly adapting to your specific needs. With a \u003cstrong\u003eCRI +92\u003c/strong\u003e index, it guarantees vibrant and faithful colors, ideal for highlighting details and creating immersive atmospheres.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts 24º beam angle focuses light to highlight specific elements,\u003c/strong\u003e while its low \u003cstrong\u003eUGR13\u003c/strong\u003e index eliminates glare, offering comfortable and professional lighting. Ideal for highlighting and transforming your spaces with high-quality lighting, integrating perfectly into any style and space.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Track Spotlight 40W - 28W ODENSE White Single-Phase Track - CCT - CRI+92 - UGR13 - 24º\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the excellence of the \u003cstrong\u003eODENSE CCT LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e. Compact elegant design with outstanding performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdjustable Color Temperature and Power:\u003c/strong\u003e CCT, 40W to 28W\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh CRI (+92):\u003c/strong\u003e Vibrant authentic colors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e24º Beam Angle:\u003c/strong\u003e Precise focused lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow UGR13 Glare Index\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Lens and Reflector:\u003c/strong\u003e PMMA hemispherical collimator, polished aluminum specular reflector\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBRIDGELUX COB Diode:\u003c/strong\u003e 2240 DS-C30 cores\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGXtronic Driver:\u003c/strong\u003e 5-year warranty\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnergy Savings:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 90%\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUses\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShowcases, offices, art galleries, museums.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty.\u003c/p\u003e",
